    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "An Absolutely Superb Opportunity is presented to the Market with the advent of 519\r\nMill Race Lawns, Broadford to the property websites.\r\nThe property combines convenience to all modern services, including schools, with\r\nthe quietness, peace and privacy offered by its idyllic countryside location, yet is not\r\nisolated, as it is one of approximately 20 similar properties in this development.\r\nThe property offers excellent accommodation in the form of Kitchen, large\r\nDining/Livingroom, 4 Double Bedrooms and a Bathroom, built on a very large site\r\nwith extremely spacious rear garden, providing excellent potential to extend with the\r\nrelevant planning permission. The property also benefits from a large Solid\r\nConstruction Outhouse with electricity, a Wooden garden shed and a separate Boiler\r\nhouse with storage.\r\nThere is also a large side entrance providing flexibility for the owner, and further\r\npotential. The property features Double Glazed windows, two Solid Fuel Stoves, a\r\nsolid fuel Fireplace and Oil Fired Central heating. There is a large cobble locked\r\npatio area to the rear, accessed via French Doors from the Spacious Livingroom.\r\nThis property provides an excellent opportunity for a buyer interested in having\r\nspace to enjoy the amenity of the large garden, or to a buyer who wants to possibly\r\nwork from home using the Outhouse as an office.\r\nExcellently located within a 12 minute drive of the busy and expanding town of\r\nEnfield with its quick access to the Motorway and its excellent Bus and Train\r\ncommuter services, viewing of this exceptional property is very highly recommended\r\nby appointment with the Agent Brid Feely MIPAV on 0872052659.\r\n\r\n\r\nPRICE REGION ; 350,000.00 EURO\r\nBER CERT ; EXPECTED TO BE D BUT AWAITING FULL RESULTS IN THIS WEEK"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall                                  ;                                               Solid Wooden Floor. Spotlights. Attic Access..\r\n\r\nKitchen                                            ;             12'8'' x 12'0''            Tiled floor and splashback. Extensive range of Pine Kitchen units with stainless steel sink. Velux window. Solid fuel stove which heats radiators. Hotpress off. Free standing Kitchen appliances. Double Doors to Living/Dining\r\n\r\nLiving/Dining                                 ;              23'0'' x 13'4''            Wooden floor. Dual aspect. Solid fuel stove in fireplace with Wooden surround . French doors to private rear Cobblelocked Patio and large Garden.\r\n\r\nMaster Bedroom                          ;             13'0'' x 10'3''             Wooden floor. Built in Wardrobes and shelving. \r\n\r\nBedroom 2                                    ;              12'2'' x 9'1''               Wooden floor. Built in Wardrobes.\r\n\r\nBathroom                                     ;                 6'3'' x 5'7''               Tiled walls. Laminate wooden floor. WC, WHB and Bath with Bath screen. Electric shower. Extractor fan. Wall mounted mirror\r\n\r\nBedroom 3                                  ;                 10'10'' x 9'10''          Feature fireplace with solid fuel inset, Marble hearth. \r\n\r\nBedroom 4                                 ;                  10'0'' x 6'10''            Solid Wooden floor.\r\n\r\n---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- \r\n\r\nEXTERIOR BUILDINGS ;\r\nLARGE SOLID CONSTRUCTION STORAGE SHED WHICH HAS ELECTRICITY.\r\nWOODEN GARDEN SHED\r\nBOILER HOUSE\r\nLARGE SIDE ENTRANCE\r\nLARGE REAR GARDEN PROVIDING PLENTY OF POTENTIAL TO EXTEND."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "ADDITIONAL FEATURES ;\r\n- Proximity to Dublin (40 minutes drive) with nearby public transport links for\r\ncommuters\r\n- Proximity to primary school (easy walking distance) and 4 secondary schools\r\nnearby\r\n- 4 double bedrooms\r\n- large front and back gardens (approximately a third of an Acre)\r\n- huge potential for a 5th room with the large outhouse (25 sqm), where there is\r\nalso an option for modification/conversion of the outhouse to a substantial\r\nincome generator (due to the new planning exemption regulations that came\r\n\r\ninto effect in Ireland on July 27, 2026, whereby an outhouse can be rented out\r\nas a standalone dwelling/modular housing, without planning permission)\r\n- the area of the house is 100m 2 (125m 2 including the large outhouse)\r\n- Quiet, well established neighbourhood\r\n- Double glazed windows and OFCH\r\n- Large Side Entrance enabling owner to drive from front to the rear of the\r\nproperty, with parking space to rear and front of house for multiple vehicles\r\n- 12 min drive to nearby Enfield with all its shopping, sporting, recreational\r\nfacilities and excellent Train and Bus commuter services"
      },
